  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "mulch",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/32/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Utilisé sur une parcelle de terre\n:   Les phases de croissance des plantes dureront chacune 25 % plus longtemps.  Assèche la terre plus lentement.\n",
      "short_effect": "Le temps de croissance des baies est augmenté, mais le sol se dessèche plus lentement.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Used on a patch of soil\n:   Plant’s growth stages will each last 25% more time.  Dries soil out more slowly.",
      "short_effect": "Growing time of berries is increased, but the soil dries out slower.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "A plant fertilizer spread on soft soil.\nIt slows the growth of Berries and\ncauses the soil to dry slower.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "diamond-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/8/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A plant fertilizer spread on soft soil.\nIt slows the growth of Berries and\ncauses the soil to dry slower.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "platinum",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/9/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A fertilizer to be spread on soft soil.\nIt slows the growth of Berries and\ncauses the soil to dry slower.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "heartgold-soulsilver",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/10/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un engrais utilisé sur sol meuble.\nLes amateurs en donnent un bon prix.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A fertilizer to be spread on soft soil\nin regions where Berries are grown.\nA maniac will buy it for a high price.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A fertilizer to be spread on soft soil\nin regions where Berries are grown.\nA maniac will buy it for a high price.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "きのみを　そだてる　ちほうでは\nふかふかのつちに　まいて　つかう。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "나무열매를 키우는 지방에서는\n푹신푹신한 땅에 뿌려 쓴다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un engrais à utiliser sur un sol meuble.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In Regionen, wo man Beeren anbaut,\nmengt man ihn unter weiche Lehmerde.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un fertilizante usado en suelo fértil donde crecen\nlas bayas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Viene usato nelle regioni in cui si coltivano\nle bacche per concimare il terreno soffice.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A fertilizer to be spread on soft soil\nin regions where Berries are grown.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "きのみを　育てる　地方では\nふかふかのつちに　まいて　使う。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un fertilizante usado en suelo fértil donde crecen\nlas bayas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "きのみを　そだてるときの　ひりょう。\nしかし　ホウエンちほうの　つちには\nまるで　なじまないので　こうかが　ない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "나무열매를 키울 때 사용하는 비료.\n그러나 호연지방의 흙에는\n전혀 맞지 않기에 효과가 없다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "培育樹果時的肥料。\n但完全不適合豐緣地區的土壤，\n所以沒什麼效果。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un engrais à utiliser sur un sol meuble.\nIl n’est cependant pas adapté aux terres\nde Hoenn et n’y a aucun effet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mulch zur Nutzung auf Beerenfeldern. Durch seine\nUnverträglichkeit mit den Böden in Hoenn bleibt\nsein Einsatz dort ohne Wirkung.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un fertilizante usado para el cultivo de bayas.\nParece que no se asienta bien en el suelo de\nHoenn, por lo que no tiene efecto en esta región.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Fertilizzante usato per coltivare le bacche.\nTuttavia, non ha effetto a Hoenn, perché\nnon è adatto al terreno della regione.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A fertilizer for growing Berries. However, it appears\nto be unsuitable for the soil in the Hoenn region and\nhas no effect.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "きのみを　育てるときの　肥料。\nしかし　ホウエン地方の　土には\nまるで　なじまないので　効果が　ない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "培育树果时的肥料。\n但完全不适合丰缘地区的土壤，\n所以没什么效果。",
