      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A fertilizer for growing Berries. However, it appears\nto be unsuitable for the soil in the Hoenn region and\nhas no effect.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "きのみを　育てるときの　肥料。\nしかし　ホウエン地方の　土には\nまるで　なじまないので　効果が　ない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "培育树果时的肥料。\n但完全不适合丰缘地区的土壤，\n所以没什么效果。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un fertilizante usado para el cultivo de bayas. Parece\nque no se asienta bien en el suelo de Hoenn, por lo\nque no tiene efecto en esta región.",
